msgid "安装 ReliefOS"
msgstr "Installing ReliefOS"

msgid "安装前"
msgstr "Before Installation"

msgid ""
"备份目标磁盘。安装器的重新分区、格式化会破坏所选磁盘的数据； 先用磁盘型号、容量和现有分区核对身份，不能只凭设备编号判断。 默认介质包括 "
"``reliefos-installer.iso``、``reliefos-live.iso`` 和 ``reliefos.vmdk``， "
"同一介质支持 Legacy BIOS 与 UEFI。ISO 使用双 El Torito 光盘入口， 不承诺是可直接写入 U 盘的 hybrid "
"镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Back up the target disk. Repartitioning and formatting by the installer "
"destroy data on the selected disk. Verify its identity using the model, "
"capacity, and existing partitions, rather than relying only on the device"
" number. Default media include ``reliefos-installer.iso``, ``reliefos-"
"live.iso``, and ``reliefos.vmdk``; the same medium supports Legacy BIOS "
"and UEFI. The ISO uses dual El Torito optical boot entries and is not "
"guaranteed to be a hybrid image that can be written directly to a USB "
"drive."

msgid "安装器运行时、Live 会话和安装后的系统是不同的根文件系统。 只有实际安装并移除 ISO 后启动成功，才能证明安装后的系统可用。"
msgstr ""
"The installer runtime, Live session, and installed system use different "
"root filesystems. Only a successful boot after actual installation and "
"removal of the ISO proves that the installed system is usable."

msgid "全新安装"
msgstr "Fresh Installation"

msgid ""
"在 GRUB 中选择图形安装或控制台安装；控制台会话条目为 ``Install ReliefOS (console "
"session)``。图形和控制台向导使用相同的步骤顺序： 语言、许可证、安装模式、目标磁盘、引导方式、分区方案、系统选项、账户、 "
"安装摘要、安装进度和结果。更新模式只显示适用的磁盘检查、摘要、更新进度和结果， 不会要求重新配置账户、分区或桌面。"
msgstr ""
"In GRUB, choose graphical or console installation; the console entry is "
"``Install ReliefOS (console session)``. Both interfaces follow the same "
"steps: language, license, installation mode, target disk, bootloaders, "
"partition layout, system options, accounts, review, progress, and result."
" Update mode shows only the applicable disk inspection, review, update "
"progress, and result, without asking to reconfigure accounts, partitions,"
" or the desktop."

msgid ""
"桌面环境默认选择 IceWM；也可选择 XFCE（实验性）或纯控制台系统。 XFCE 包含面板、窗口管理器、桌面、Thunar 文件管理器和 "
"XFCE Terminal， 使用锁定版本的 Alpine 官方包，随安装介质提供，安装时不需要联网。 XFCE 会话由 "
"``/etc/X11/Xsession`` 启动，使用独立的 D-Bus 会话； 用户可通过可执行的 ``~/.xsession`` "
"覆盖系统默认会话。 XFCE 默认关闭窗口合成；用户可在“窗口管理器微调”中开启。 实验性 XFCE "
"在软件渲染环境中首次登录时，桌面和面板可能需要较长时间才能出现。 切换安装向导选项不会修改正在运行的安装器桌面，也不会在更新模式中更换已有桌面。"
msgstr ""
"Choose IceWM (default), experimental XFCE, or a console-only system. XFCE"
" includes a panel, window manager, desktop, Thunar file manager, and XFCE"
" Terminal, using pinned packages from Alpine’s official repositories "
"bundled on the installation media; installation therefore works offline. "
"The XFCE session starts through ``/etc/X11/Xsession`` in its own D-Bus "
"session. Users can override the default session with an executable "
"``~/.xsession``. Compositing is disabled by default and can be enabled in"
" Window Manager Tweaks. On software-rendered systems, the first XFCE "
"login may take some time to show the desktop and panel. Changing the "
"installer selection does not change the currently running installer "
"desktop or replace an existing desktop during a system update."

msgid ""
"控制台安装器使用原版 ncursesw，提供与图形向导对应的语言、许可证、安装／更新、 "
"磁盘、引导、分区、系统选项、账户、确认及完成页面。终端中直接运行 ``installer`` 或 ``installer "
"--text``；图形入口为 ``installer --graphical``。 支持英文、中文和日文，字符显示依赖终端及其字体覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"The console installer uses upstream ncursesw and offers language, "
"license, install/update, disk, bootloader, partition, system options, "
"account, review, and completion pages corresponding to the graphical "
"wizard. Run ``installer`` or ``installer --text`` in a terminal. Use "
"``installer --graphical`` for the graphical interface. English, Chinese, "
"and Japanese are supported. Character rendering depends on the terminal "
"and its font coverage."

# | msgid "" "使用 Tab、Shift+Tab 和方向键选择控件，空格切换选项，Enter 激活所选按钮， F3 继续、F2
# | 返回修改，PgUp／PgDn " "滚动页面或许可证。界面适配终端大小， 需要至少 60 列、20
# 行。密码以遮罩显示；安装及分区操作由后台进程执行，
# | " "进度页保留当前阶段、百分比和活动详情。新安装日志为 ``/var/log/installer.log``，系统更新详情日志为
# | ``/var/log" "/installer-update.log``。"
msgid ""
"使用 Tab、Shift+Tab 和方向键选择控件，空格切换选项，Enter 激活所选按钮， F3 继续、F2 返回修改，PgUp／PgDn "
"滚动页面或许可证。界面适配终端大小， 需要至少 60 列、20 行。密码以遮罩显示。GUI 和 TUI 的安装复制与同步、 以及 TUI "
"的分区操作均在后台进程中执行；进度通道拥塞时合并进度， 不会阻塞复制，也不会把未完成的后台任务误报为成功。 "
"进度页保留当前阶段、百分比和活动详情。新建 ext4 根分区在格式化时直接写入 所选系统文件，写入期间显示已用时间。手动选择 ext3 "
"时继续按文件复制。 新安装日志为 ``/var/log/installer.log``，系统更新详情日志为 ``/var/log"
"/installer-update.log``。"
msgstr ""
"Use Tab, Shift+Tab, and the arrow keys to select controls. Space toggles "
"options; Enter activates the selected button. F3 continues, F2 returns to"
" edit the choices, and PgUp/PgDn scroll pages or the license. The "
"interface adapts to the terminal and requires at least 60 columns and 20 "
"rows. Passwords are masked. File copying and synchronization in both the "
"GUI and TUI installers, and partition operations in the TUI, run in "
"background processes. When the progress channel is busy, updates are "
"coalesced so they do not block copying or report unfinished work as "
"successful. The progress page shows the current stage, percentage, and "
"activity details. While formatting a new ext4 root partition, the "
"installer writes the selected system files directly and displays elapsed "
"time. Manually selected ext3 partitions continue to use file-by-file "
"copying. Fresh installations log to ``/var/log/installer.log``; detailed "
"system-update logs are written to ``/var/log/installer-update.log``."

msgid ""
"图形向导在语言选择后显示 Apache License 2.0 英文原文，可滚动阅读全文。 该文本直接取自仓库的 "
"``LICENSE``，中文界面也保留许可证原文。"
msgstr ""
"After language selection, the graphical wizard displays the original "
"English Apache License 2.0, with scrolling to read the full text. This "
"text comes directly from the repository's ``LICENSE``; the Chinese "
"interface also retains the original license text."

msgid ""
"新安装默认同时安装 BIOS、UEFI 引导器，可分别取消。两者都取消时不写入 可直接启动的 loader，必须另行配置引导。自动 GPT "
"布局根据所选引导方式生成："
msgstr ""
"A fresh installation installs both BIOS and UEFI boot loaders by default;"
" either can be deselected. If both are deselected, no directly bootable "
"loader is written, and boot must be configured separately. The automatic "
"GPT layout is generated according to the chosen boot methods:"

msgid ""
"选择 BIOS 时创建 1 MiB 未格式化 BIOS Boot 分区；只选 UEFI 或都不选时省去该分区。 BIOS Boot "
"不能格式化、挂载或直接占用已有文件系统。"
msgstr ""
"Selecting BIOS creates a 1 MiB unformatted BIOS Boot partition; it is "
"omitted when only UEFI or neither method is selected. BIOS Boot must not "
"be formatted, mounted, or placed directly over an existing filesystem."

msgid ""
"所有方案都创建 128 MiB FAT32 ESP，保存内核、GRUB 配置及所选引导器的资源。 BIOS 引导同样从该 FAT32 "
"分区读取启动资源，不能因为只选 BIOS 而删除它。"
msgstr ""
"Every layout creates a 128 MiB FAT32 ESP for the kernel, GRUB "
"configuration, and resources for the selected loaders. BIOS boot also "
"reads boot resources from this FAT32 partition; do not remove it just "
"because only BIOS is selected."

msgid "剩余整 MiB 空间用作 ext4 根分区。"
msgstr "The remaining whole-MiB space becomes the ext4 root partition."

msgid ""
"手动分区可选择 ext3 根分区，安装器按所选类型格式化，并在目标系统的 ``/etc/fstab`` 中保存 ``ext3`` 和 "
"``data=ordered``。"
msgstr ""
"Manual partitioning can use an ext3 root partition. The installer formats"
" it with the selected filesystem type and records ``ext3`` and "
"``data=ordered`` in the target system's ``/etc/fstab``."

msgid ""
"TUI 分区页提供容量示意条和分区表格，列出设备、容量、文件系统、用途及名称。 "
"自动模式显示待应用的方案，手动模式按磁盘位置显示现有分区和可用空闲区。 表格内使用上下键选择、PgUp／PgDn 翻页、Home／End "
"跳到首尾，Tab 转到操作栏。 空闲区不会被当作已有分区执行重命名、格式化或删除操作；小分区在示意条中至少 保留一个字符，精确容量以表格为准。"
msgstr ""
"The TUI partition page provides a capacity map and a table of devices, "
"sizes, filesystems, roles, and names. Automatic mode previews the pending"
" layout. Manual mode lists existing partitions and usable free extents in"
" physical disk order. Inside the table, use Up/Down to select a row, "
"PgUp/PgDn to change pages, Home/End for the first or last row, and Tab to"
" reach the action bar. Free space cannot be renamed, formatted, or "
"deleted as an existing partition. Tiny partitions retain at least one "
"character in the map; the table gives their exact capacity."

msgid ""
"分区页中的自动方案和手动编辑都是尚未写盘的草稿。 初始化 GPT、创建、删除、重命名、角色分配、格式化及容量调整先记录到方案， "
"只有在最终摘要中输入 ``INSTALL`` 并启动安装后才执行。 返回修改、刷新分区页以及在自动和手动方案之间切换，不会执行这些操作； "
"手动草稿可显式放弃并重新读取磁盘。退出安装器会丢弃未执行的方案。 已有文件系统的分区不支持缩小，不能把修改分区边界当成文件系统缩容。"
msgstr ""
"Automatic layouts and manual partition edits are drafts that have not "
"been written to disk. GPT initialization, creation, deletion, renaming, "
"role assignment, formatting, and size changes are recorded in the plan "
"and run only after entering ``INSTALL`` on the final review and starting "
"installation. Returning to earlier steps, refreshing the partition page, "
"or switching between automatic and manual layouts does not execute these "
"operations. Explicitly discard a manual draft to reread the disk. Exiting"
" the installer discards unapplied plans. Shrinking partitions containing "
"an existing filesystem is unsupported; changing a partition boundary does"
" not shrink that filesystem."

msgid ""
"返回修改引导方式会重新计算自动方案，并检查手动方案是否包含所需分区。 手动方案必须为所选 BIOS 引导提供合格的 BIOS Boot "
"分区，也必须指定根分区和 ESP。 最终摘要列出所选磁盘、分区变更、将格式化或保留的分区、引导方式、桌面和交换文件。 "
"开始写盘前再次核对原始分区表及文件系统头；磁盘已被其他程序更改时， 拒绝执行过期的方案，需要重新检查和确认。"
msgstr ""
"Changing bootloaders recalculates the automatic layout and checks that a "
"manual plan contains the required partitions. Manual layouts need a valid"
" BIOS Boot partition when BIOS is selected, as well as an assigned root "
"and ESP. The final review lists the disk, partition changes, partitions "
"to format or preserve, bootloaders, desktop, and swap file. Before "
"writing, the installer compares the original partition table and "
"filesystem headers again. If another program changed the disk, the stale "
"plan is rejected and must be inspected and confirmed again."

msgid ""
"格式化前会检查所选载荷需要的空间和 inode。菜单通过 GPT PARTUUID 绑定 "
"根分区；缺失、无效或重复身份应报错，不能以连接顺序替代身份。 完成后正常关机、移除安装介质，再从目标磁盘启动。"
msgstr ""
"Before formatting, the installer checks the space and inode requirements "
"of the selected payload. Menus bind the root partition by GPT PARTUUID. "
"Missing, invalid, or duplicate identities must produce an error; "
"connection order must not replace identity. After completion, shut down "
"normally, remove the installation medium, and boot from the target disk."

msgid ""
"全新安装可选择创建根分区的 ``/swapfile``，默认不选。建议值为内存大小向上 取整到 MiB 后限制在 512 MiB 至 2 "
"GiB；可以手动填写其他有效的整数 MiB， 安装器不会自动缩小。所需文件空间和余量在重新分区或格式化之前一起检查。 "
"该选项要求所选目标系统的已验证内核包启用 swap，且目标磁盘的真实 PCI 父 控制器为 AHCI；当前不支持用 NVMe、IDE "
"或其他存储作为这个 swap 后端。 安装器不会在 Live 或安装器会话中启用目标 swap。"
msgstr ""
"Fresh installations can optionally create ``/swapfile`` on the root "
"partition; this is unchecked by default. The suggested size is RAM "
"rounded up to MiB, clamped to 512 MiB–2 GiB. Other valid integer MiB "
"values can be entered manually; the installer does not shrink them "
"automatically. File space and required headroom are checked together "
"before repartitioning or formatting. This option requires swap to be "
"enabled in the selected target system's verified kernel package and the "
"target disk's actual PCI parent controller to be AHCI. NVMe, IDE, and "
"other storage are not currently supported as this swap backend. The "
"installer does not activate target swap in the Live or installer session."

msgid ""
"安装器完整写入并格式化文件，设置 root 所有、权限 0600，再发布 fstab 和 OpenRC 配置。标准 swap 服务在 "
"localmount 后运行；项目检查服务会核对 ``/proc/swaps`` 中实际出现的 "
"``/swapfile``，以便发现配置存在但启用失败的 情况。重启后可检查 ``/proc/swaps`` 以及服务状态。磁盘 I/O "
"或清理本身失败时， 安装器会报告错误；单文件同步和替换不构成跨文件的断电原子事务。"
msgstr ""
"The installer fully writes and formats the file, sets root ownership and "
"mode 0600, then publishes fstab and OpenRC configuration. The standard "
"swap service runs after localmount; the project's check service verifies "
"that ``/swapfile`` actually appears in ``/proc/swaps`` to detect "
"configured-but-inactive swap. After reboot, inspect ``/proc/swaps`` and "
"service status. Disk I/O or cleanup failures are reported as errors. "
"Syncing and replacing individual files does not form a power-failure-"
"atomic transaction across files."

msgid ""
"未选择此项时不会自动启用 swap。手工配置须先准备完全分配、位于支持的 AHCI SATA 设备上的专用文件或未挂载分区，再使用 "
"``mkswap`` 初始化并通过 ``swapon`` 激活；``mkswap`` 会覆盖所选目标。只有完成身份核对和必要备份后 "
"才能执行。``swapoff`` 需要先恢复仍被引用的页面，内存不足时可能失败并保留 "
"活动区域；不能把失败当成已卸载，也不保证所有后续分配立即成功。"
msgstr ""
"If this option is not selected, swap is not enabled automatically. For "
"manual configuration, first prepare a fully allocated dedicated file or "
"unmounted partition on a supported AHCI SATA device, initialize it with "
"``mkswap``, and activate it with ``swapon``. ``mkswap`` overwrites the "
"selected target; run it only after verifying identity and making "
"necessary backups. ``swapoff`` must first restore pages that are still "
"referenced. If memory is insufficient, it may fail and leave the area "
"active; failure must not be treated as successful deactivation, nor is "
"immediate success of all subsequent allocations guaranteed."

msgid "共享 ESP 与多系统"
msgstr "Shared ESP and Multiple Operating Systems"

msgid ""
"与已有系统共存时选择手动分区，为 ReliefOS 指定单独的根分区。 所选根分区会格式化；已有 FAT32 ESP "
"默认保留，不要求它达到自动方案的 128 MiB，但必须有足够剩余空间。只有显式勾选格式化 ESP 才会清除其中的 所有 EFI 文件。TUI "
"在分区页提供相同的“格式化所选 ESP”选项。 自动分区仍是明确的整盘擦除方案，不是保留其他系统的并列安装。"
msgstr ""
"To coexist with an existing system, select manual partitioning and assign"
" a dedicated ReliefOS root partition. The selected root partition will be"
" formatted. An existing FAT32 ESP is preserved by default and can be "
"smaller than the automatic layout's 128 MiB if it has sufficient free "
"space. Explicitly selecting ESP formatting erases all its EFI files. The "
"TUI provides the same ESP-formatting option on the partition page. "
"Automatic partitioning is an explicit whole-disk erasure operation."

msgid ""
"新安装将物理 ESP 挂到 ``/efi``，并把 ``/efi/reliefos/instances/<根分区 PARTUUID>`` bind"
" 到 ``/boot``。 每个实例有独立的 GRUB 配置、根分区绑定、A/B 内核状态和版本文件； "
"内核包更新检查实例所有权，拒绝把当前根的内核发布到另一个实例。 initramfs 在切换真实根之前按 fstab 完成两层挂载。"
msgstr ""
"New installations mount the physical ESP at ``/efi`` and bind "
"``/efi/reliefos/instances/<根分区 PARTUUID>`` to ``/boot``. Each instance "
"has its own GRUB configuration, root binding, A/B kernel state, and "
"version files. Kernel package updates verify instance ownership and "
"refuse to publish the current root's kernel to another instance. Before "
"switching to the real root, initramfs performs both mount layers "
"according to fstab."

msgid ""
"UEFI 文件位于 ``/EFI/ReliefOS/<根分区 PARTUUID>/grubx64.efi``； 标准厂商入口 "
"``/EFI/ReliefOS/grubx64.efi`` 指向一个已有安装，其菜单可选择其他实例。 已有的其他系统 EFI 文件和未知的 "
"``/EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI`` 保持不变。 只有空的 fallback 路径，或内容摘要和所有权记录均匹配的 ReliefOS"
" fallback， 才会被安装或更新。固件启动变量和 BootOrder 不由此文件复制过程修改； 若固件没有显示新入口，使用完成页显示的 "
"EFI 文件路径添加启动项。"
msgstr ""
"UEFI files reside at ``/EFI/ReliefOS/<根分区 PARTUUID>/grubx64.efi``. The "
"standard vendor entry ``/EFI/ReliefOS/grubx64.efi`` points to an existing"
" installation whose menu can select other instances. Other systems' "
"existing EFI files and any unknown ``/EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI`` are left "
"unchanged. Only an empty fallback path or a ReliefOS fallback whose "
"content digest and ownership record both match may be installed or "
"updated. This file-copy process does not alter firmware boot variables or"
" BootOrder. If firmware does not display the new entry, add a boot entry "
"using the EFI path shown on the completion page."

msgid ""
"GRUB 在启动时枚举其他 ReliefOS 实例；UEFI 菜单识别常见的 Windows、 shim/GRUB 和 systemd-boot "
"文件，BIOS 菜单支持 Windows 分区引导及其他 系统的 GRUB 配置。其他系统的配置只在用户选择相应条目后执行。 BIOS "
"安装会替换所选整盘的主引导代码；只需 UEFI 共存时可取消 BIOS。 旧预制磁盘若没有 ESP 上的 ``core.img`` "
"副本，更新器会校验 MBR 中的 GRUB 核心位置及 BIOS Boot 分区内的块列表，识别实际嵌入的引导器。 "
"新预制镜像同时保存该副本，保持与安装器生成的布局一致。"
msgstr ""
"At boot, GRUB enumerates other ReliefOS instances. UEFI menus recognize "
"common Windows, shim/GRUB, and systemd-boot files; BIOS menus support "
"Windows partition booting and GRUB configurations from other systems. "
"Other systems' configurations execute only after the user selects their "
"entry. BIOS installation replaces the master boot code of the selected "
"whole disk; deselect BIOS if only UEFI coexistence is needed. For old "
"prebuilt disks without a copy of ``core.img`` on the ESP, the updater "
"checks the GRUB core location in the MBR and block lists in the BIOS Boot"
" partition to identify the embedded loader. New prebuilt images also "
"retain this copy, matching installer-generated layouts."

msgid ""
"Live 只有一个普通启动项。安装介质保留图形和控制台两个安装入口； 磁盘保留普通启动及高级选项中的日志暂停、关闭内核日志颜色和有效旧内核回退。 "
"不再展示失效的 debug/autospawn 参数、重复日志条目或同内核副本伪装的回退。 ISO 优先从固件交接的实际介质加载菜单，Live 与"
" Installer 的后备标记相互独立。"
msgstr ""
"Live has a single normal boot entry. Installation media retain graphical "
"and console installation entries; disks retain normal boot and advanced "
"options for pausing logs, disabling kernel log colors, and falling back "
"to a valid old kernel. Obsolete debug/autospawn parameters, duplicate log"
" entries, and copies of the same kernel disguised as fallbacks are no "
"longer shown. ISOs prefer loading menus from the actual medium handed "
"over by firmware, with independent fallback markers for Live and "
"Installer."

msgid "独立磁盘镜像身份"
msgstr "Independent Disk Image Identities"

msgid ""
"``IMAGE_INSTANCE_ID``（也可在 menuconfig 中设置 ``DISK_INSTANCE_ID``） 决定预制磁盘的 "
"GPT 磁盘和分区身份，并同步生成 fstab、GRUB 根绑定和查找标记。 "
"同一输入、同一实例标识保持可重现；需要同时连接的镜像应使用不同标识，例如::"
msgstr ""
"``IMAGE_INSTANCE_ID`` (also configurable as ``DISK_INSTANCE_ID`` in "
"menuconfig) determines GPT disk and partition identities for prebuilt "
"disks, generating matching fstab, GRUB root bindings, and search markers."
" Identical input and instance IDs remain reproducible. Images that will "
"be attached simultaneously should use different IDs, for example::"

msgid ""
"逐字节复制一张已有磁盘仍会复制其 UUID，不能把这样的副本当作独立安装同时连接。 正式安装到不同根分区时使用各自 GPT "
"身份，不依赖预制镜像的实例标识。"
msgstr ""
"Copying an existing disk byte for byte also copies its UUIDs; such a copy"
" cannot be attached simultaneously as an independent installation. Actual"
" installations on different root partitions use their respective GPT "
"identities and do not depend on prebuilt image instance IDs."

msgid "更新已有系统"
msgstr "Updating an Existing System"

msgid ""
"更新不自动重分区。旧两分区 UEFI 磁盘保持原有布局，缺少 BIOS Boot 空间时增加 BIOS "
"引导的请求应在写入前失败。先备份用户文件和引导分区， 检查已安装 APK 数据库、信任密钥及所选更新介质。正常关闭已安装系统后， "
"再从安装介质启动。 在安装器中选择更新和目标磁盘后，独立的后台进程只读检查已安装系统、桌面 "
"类型、软件包数据库、安装介质和空间。检查完成后仍留在目标磁盘步骤， 显示检查结果和检测到的 BIOS/UEFI "
"引导选项；可以先修改选择，再继续到只读摘要。 摘要列出当前版本、介质版本、根分区、ESP、空间需求和引导方式。核对后点击更新。 "
"同盘有多个安装时，可在目标磁盘页选择明确的根分区和 ESP；留空 ESP 时读取 所选根的 fstab，不能简单取磁盘上第一个 "
"ESP。显式选择与该根的 fstab 不一致时 拒绝更新，避免把引导文件写到其他系统的分区。旧的 ``/boot`` 直接挂载 FAT32 "
"布局继续兼容，更新不强制改变现有挂载布局。 旧布局中未能通过所有权验证的现有 EFI 可执行文件及相邻配置会保留， 不会因系统更新而覆盖。兼容命令"
" ``reliefos-grub-installer`` 现直接转交原生 CLI，需要明确的 ``--disk``、``--boot-"
"directory`` 和根分区身份； 不再接受无法绑定安装实例的旧式单个 ESP 路径复制操作。 TTY "
"入口使用相同的后端，并在显示摘要和引导选项后通过 ``y/N`` 确认。"
msgstr ""
"Updates do not repartition automatically. Old two-partition UEFI disks "
"retain their layout; a request to add BIOS boot without BIOS Boot space "
"must fail before writing. First back up user files and boot partitions, "
"and check the installed APK database, trusted keys, and selected update "
"medium. Shut down the installed system normally before booting "
"installation media. After Update and a target disk are selected in the "
"installer, a separate background process performs read-only checks of the"
" installed system, desktop type, package database, installation medium, "
"and space. After inspection, the target disk step remains open and shows "
"the results and detected BIOS/UEFI bootloader choices. Adjust these "
"before continuing to the read-only review. The review lists the current "
"and medium versions, root partition, ESP, space requirements, and "
"bootloaders. Verify these and click Update. If the same disk contains "
"multiple installations, choose an explicit root partition and ESP on the "
"target disk page. Leaving ESP blank reads the selected root's fstab, "
"rather than simply taking the disk's first ESP. An explicit selection "
"inconsistent with that root's fstab is rejected to avoid writing boot "
"files to another system's partition. Legacy layouts mounting FAT32 "
"directly at ``/boot`` remain compatible; updates do not force changes to "
"existing mounts. Existing EFI executables and adjacent configuration in "
"old layouts that cannot pass ownership verification are preserved, rather"
" than overwritten by the system update. The compatibility command "
"``reliefos-grub-installer`` now forwards directly to the native CLI, "
"requiring explicit ``--disk``, ``--boot-directory``, and root partition "
"identity. It no longer accepts the old operation of copying to a single "
"ESP path without binding an installation instance. The TTY entry uses the"
" same backend and requests ``y/N`` confirmation after showing the summary"
" and boot options."

msgid ""
"检查过程使用私有 APK 数据库和已安装系统的信任密钥，验证签名索引、完整 软件包归档以及离线依赖。确认后的执行会再次核对磁盘、分区 "
"UUID、索引和 已安装包数据库及 world 选择；目标已经变化时需要重新检查。已被其他路径挂载的分区、 无法唯一识别的根分区或 "
"ESP，以及早于已安装系统的介质会在写入前被拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Checks use a private APK database and the installed system's trusted keys"
" to verify signed indexes, complete package archives, and offline "
"dependencies. Execution after confirmation rechecks disks, partition "
"UUIDs, indexes, the installed package database, and world selections; "
"changed targets require a fresh check. Partitions already mounted "
"elsewhere, roots or ESPs that cannot be uniquely identified, and media "
"older than the installed system are rejected before writing."

msgid ""
"根文件系统使用 APK 更新，保留外部包、world 选择和受保护配置；新默认配置 可能以 ``.apk-new`` "
"出现。根事务成功后才发布引导文件。 离线更新只从安装介质的签名仓库取得新软件包。``world`` 中已有的 "
"``@testing``、``@alpine`` 等标签在本次事务的私有配置中注册到该仓库， "
"使已安装的外部软件包可以继续满足依赖，不要求原仓库在线或保留索引缓存。 原有仓库配置和标签选择保持不变；介质和已安装软件包无法满足的版本约束 "
"仍会在预检查时拒绝，不会强制忽略依赖。 更新保留现有 fstab 和 swap 设置，不会自动添加或更改交换文件。 "
"更新详情显示软件包和引导操作的实际输出，完整日志位于安装器运行环境的 ``/var/log/installer-"
"update.log``。失败页面保留错误和日志位置，并返回目标磁盘步骤重新检查； "
"新安装失败后也先返回检查方案，不能把重新进入进度页当作已经获准再次擦盘。"
msgstr ""
"The root filesystem is updated with APK, preserving external packages, "
"world selections, and protected configuration; new defaults may appear as"
" ``.apk-new``. Boot files are published only after the root transaction "
"succeeds. Offline updates obtain new packages only from the installation "
"medium's signed repository. Existing tags in ``world``, such as "
"``@testing`` and ``@alpine``, are registered against that repository in "
"the transaction's private configuration, allowing installed external "
"packages to continue satisfying dependencies without requiring their "
"original repositories online or cached indexes. Existing repository "
"configuration and tag selections remain unchanged. Version constraints "
"that cannot be satisfied by the medium and installed packages are still "
"rejected during preflight; dependencies are not forcibly ignored. Updates"
" preserve existing fstab and swap settings and do not automatically add "
"or change swap files. Update details show actual output from package and "
"boot operations; the full log is at ``/var/log/installer-update.log`` in "
"the installer runtime. The failure page retains the error and log "
"location and returns to target disk selection for inspection. Failed "
"fresh installations also return to plan review; entering progress again "
"does not authorize another destructive write."

msgid ""
"更新进度会显示当前的软件包或缓存归档、已处理数量和缓存大小，以及已复用的 缓存大小。大小按完成比较或发布的整个文件累计，正在复制的文件完成后计入；"
" 包事务中的数量只计入当前包之前已处理的包。缓存归档和签名索引逐字节相同 时直接复用，内容不同则先写入独立临时文件并校验，再替换原文件。比较或写入"
" 出错会终止本次更新，日志和失败页保留步骤、文件名及命令退出状态，供重试定位。"
msgstr ""
"Update progress shows the current package or cached archive, processed "
"count, cache size, and reused cache size. Sizes accumulate whole files "
"after comparison or publication completes; a file being copied is counted"
" only when finished. Package-transaction counts include only packages "
"processed before the current package. Byte-identical cached archives and "
"signed indexes are reused directly; differing contents are first written "
"to separate temporary files, verified, and then replace the originals. "
"Comparison or write errors terminate the update. The log and failure page"
" retain the step, filename, and command exit status for diagnosing "
"retries."

msgid ""
"目标系统的 ``/var/lib/reliefos/installer-update/state`` 持久记录软件包、根同步、 "
"引导提交和完成阶段。同一介质的引导提交失败后，重新检查会核对已完成的根 事务，再继续引导提交；软件包阶段失败则重新预检并执行包事务。旧内核模块 "
"保留与 A/B 内核发布继续使用共同的原生引导接口。更新期间由独立进程持有 安装器更新锁，释放目标挂载后才报告完成。APK "
"已记录为损坏的系统包会先通过 已验证的归档执行定向修复，再执行升级；已有的外部包错误保留并在日志中说明。"
msgstr ""
"The target system's ``/var/lib/reliefos/installer-update/state`` "
"persistently records package, root sync, boot commit, and completion "
"phases. After a boot commit fails for the same medium, rechecking "
"verifies the completed root transaction and resumes the boot commit; a "
"package-phase failure triggers a fresh preflight and package transaction."
" Retention of old kernel modules and A/B kernel publishing continue to "
"share the native boot interface. A separate process holds the installer "
"update lock throughout the update, reporting completion only after "
"releasing target mounts. System packages marked broken by APK are first "
"repaired selectively using verified archives, then upgraded. Existing "
"external-package errors are retained and explained in the log."

msgid ""
"旧内核包清单中的 ``kerneldebug.sys`` 作为可选历史成员继续校验、保留和恢复， 以支持升级旧安装；新内核包和 ESP "
"发布不生成该文件。历史成员若损坏或是符号 链接，仍会拒绝更新，不会跳过内核包完整性检查。"
msgstr ""
"``kerneldebug.sys`` in old kernel package manifests continues to be "
"verified, retained, and restored as an optional historical member to "
"support upgrading old installations. New kernel packages and ESP "
"publishing do not generate this file. A corrupted or symbolic-link "
"historical member still causes update rejection; kernel package integrity"
" checks are not skipped."

msgid ""
"单文件原子替换不等于全部包、ESP 和 BIOS 写入的整体断电原子事务。 回退条目只使用通过完整性检查的匹配内核与 "
"initramfs，不把当前内核的别名当作回退。"
msgstr ""
"Atomic replacement of a single file is not a power-failure-atomic "
"transaction covering all packages, ESP, and BIOS writes. Fallback entries"
" use only matching kernels and initramfs images that pass integrity "
"checks, never aliases of the current kernel presented as fallbacks."

msgid "运行验证和未覆盖范围见 :doc:`limitations`。"
msgstr "For runtime verification and uncovered areas, see :doc:`limitations`."

msgid ""
"安装前可以用“上一步”返回，图形侧栏也可回到已经经过的配置步骤。 修改磁盘、引导方式、分区或系统选项后，摘要根据当前选择重新生成； "
"账户密码不会出现在摘要或日志中。图形许可证页面需明确勾选确认， 控制台通过“接受并继续”确认。 "
"桌面和交换文件在单独的“系统选项”步骤配置，最终摘要只用于核对， 不会在即将开始安装时再混入新的配置项。"
msgstr ""
"Before installation, use Back to edit earlier choices; the graphical "
"sidebar also returns to configuration steps already visited. Changing the"
" disk, bootloaders, partitions, or system options regenerates the review "
"from the current choices. Passwords never appear in the review or logs. "
"Explicitly check the graphical license acknowledgement, or select Accept "
"and continue in the console. Configure the desktop and swap file in the "
"separate System options step. The final review presents the choices for "
"verification without adding new settings just before installation."
